                      <SHORT-NAME>CanSMInitFastExecuteThreshold</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The maximal loop counter when invoke state machine execution function during init process. The Threshold will be 3 if empty</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">初始化阶段允许快速切换机制最大循环次数，不配置时默认为3</L-2>
                      </DESC>
