                      <SHORT-NAME>CanSMMainFuncFastExecuteThreshold</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">The maximal loop counter when invoke state machine execution function during main function process. The Threshold will be 3 if empty</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">周期函数阶段允许快速切换机制最大循环次数，不配置时默认为3</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_CanSM_00335</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
